# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Node (only used ad hoc for browser tests)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GENERATED ARTIFACTS — never committed.
#
# Every tenant corpus, logo and config is produced deterministically by
# `python -m pipeline.build_tenants` and regenerated by CI on every push.
# Committing them would put ~640 files under version control that no human
# edits, and make every registry change produce an unreadable diff.
#
# The source of truth is tenants/registry.yml plus the domain packs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tenants/*/docs/
tenants/*/brand/
tenants/*/tenant.json
tenants/*/questions.json
site/data/tenants.json
site/data/index.json
site/data/semantic.json
site/data/intent_model.json

# Generated by build_site — the SHELL is site/app.html and IS committed
site/index.html
site/kit/
site/t/

# Hand-written and committed, listed here only so the distinction is on the
# record: site/assets/, site/walkthrough/, site/deck/ and site/downloads/ are
# never written or deleted by the pipeline.
